# Re-include the Admin.UI E2E test project: its directory name ends in ".E2E", which
# the *.e2e trace-file pattern above matches by coincidence (case-insensitive on
# Windows). Keep the project source tracked while still ignoring its build output.
!tests/Hexalith.EventStore.Admin.UI.E2E/
tests/Hexalith.EventStore.Admin.UI.E2E/[Bb]in/
tests/Hexalith.EventStore.Admin.UI.E2E/[Oo]bj/

