!_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/evidence/story-3-13/80d12ef5eee71a9fe3ea7be51171da4a71b69a28/ab8784c8c9c67229ee178e9d6dd809df9554b3cdafb43ffb7bfd38c792e2afcd/packages/*.nupkg
